            <ArticleTitle>Sigmoid colon perforation due to geophagia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>130-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Geophagia can be a problem in mentally handicapped patients. This case report presents a 71-year-old mentally handicapped women who had to be operated in emergency for colonic perforation due to geophagia.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
